{
  "description": "读取本任务或同任务续接原结果，runId省略取当前运行，callId沿用软件回执引用。path从完整ToolResult根选择字段；字符串按UTF-16、数组按项、对象按键用offset/limit续读。默认有界，大单项仍递归分段，complete/omitted/read说明未交付内容与原来源；程序内部可完整运算，不能用模型raw参数绕过交付预算。",
  "inputSchema": {
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "callId": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "limit": {
        "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
        "maximum": 9007199254740991,
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "offset": {
        "maximum": 9007199254740991,
        "minimum": 0,
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "path": {
        "items": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "maximum": 9007199254740991,
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            }
          ]
        },
        "type": "array"
      },
      "runId": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "callId"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "静态目录只说明已登记接口；当前运行是否可调用、文档范围、写权限、短句柄和服务配置，以宿主本轮发现与实际回执为准。",
  "name": "programmatic.read",
  "version": 1
}
